    {
      "_key": "k0021",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Christine Sheller: A leader in design and UX",
          "_key": "k0022"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0023",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Christine Sheller is a distinguished leader with an extensive track record in building and managing design and user experience teams. At O3, Christine is responsible for overseeing all aspects of UX research and design, ensuring that our clients receive exceptional customer experiences.",
          "_key": "k0024"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0025",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Christine’s journey in design and UX has taken her through esteemed organizations such as FS Investments, SIG, Lincoln Financial Group, and Motorola, where she played pivotal roles in creating award-winning teams. Her dedication to the design community extends beyond her professional roles; she has also served on the board of AIGA Philadelphia, contributing to initiatives like the in-house design program and a design scholarship fund.",
          "_key": "k0026"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0027",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Christine holds a Master’s in User Experience Design from the Maryland Institute College of Art (MICA) and a BFA in Design from the Tyler School of Art.",
          "_key": "k0028"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0029",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Session highlight: From hurdles to high-performing teams",
          "_key": "k0030"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "k0031",
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Christine’s session is titled “From Hurdles to High-Performing Teams: Mastering Collaboration, Career, and Beyond.” She will be joined by the following impressive UX thought leaders:",
          "_key": "k0032"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "_type": "block",
      "style": "normal"
